    "behavior": "Reuse existing keyWrites promise queue for required-key reads through durable enabled setup save. Keep initial run capture before queue entry and final sign-out/profile/reference/availability guards. Add early sign-out check before queued key reads. OFF/incomplete OFF saves bypass credential queue and required-key checks. Internal key reads/status remain unqueued to avoid recursive deadlock.",
    "review": "Boris and Nadia independently proposed revision checking versus existing queue. Challenge identified the asynchronous file-publication gap in revision-only checks. Both supported the queue and reviewed the final implementation without a remaining blocker. Nadia suggested the added early sign-out check.",
